WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.250
Three points are open.

2
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:04.151
The biggest: which user
ServiceNow records for a

3
00:00:04.151 --> 00:00:07.125
call made with an OAuth
client-credentials token.

4
00:00:07.125 --> 00:00:11.562
The rule compares exactly that with its
verifier property, so if they differ

5
00:00:11.562 --> 00:00:15.787
it refuses every close, and people
start looking for a way around the rule.

6
00:00:15.787 --> 00:00:17.899
Lab 2 checks it before go-live.

7
00:00:17.899 --> 00:00:22.214
Also open: how long a SailPoint read
lags the source, which depends on the

8
00:00:22.214 --> 00:00:24.846
aggregation schedule, and how to recognize

9
00:00:24.846 --> 00:00:27.700
a ticket the Service
Desk integration opened.
